Bind Npc 24413 Zone 1
Quest 214 "Eradicate Tyon"
    Journal "You have promised [Farm Manager] to hunt Tyon."
    Kill 40 of 4351, 4301 at direction_344

Requires player level >= 49 and player is karus

Rewards
    Give 5250000 experience

direction_344 = location "Tyon" about "Tyon\nBoar monster evolved by Pathos' evil power" found "Karus" at 360 1300 in zone 1

On available
    Say "Master, The [Farm Manager] has found a great treasure! I'm curious, let's go and see it."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Treasure? Ahh, well, I was plowing the fields when I saw something shining in the dirt. So I picked it up, and it turned out to be an earring. It looks expensive, but it doesn't seem right to sell it."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Trade? Hmm... Are you strong? As you must have noticed on the way here, there are so many Tyons wandering around it makes it hard tog et anything done outside. If you take care of the Tyons, I'll give you the earring. No matter how valuable it is, it's not more precious than my farm.\n\nYou'll earn the ring that holds the Strength of Legend, if you go on the hunt after listening to  the [Farm Manager]'s story about the Tyon."

On in_progress
    Say "Catch some more! It's not right to take the earring for only that many."

On ready
    Say "I think this is enough~"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you so much. Ah~ Now I don't have to risk my life just walking around the farm. Heh."
